//    generation. In that case we interpret that token as the start of the
//    active constrained segment by switching to constrained mode with empty
//    current content, rather than opening another `<<` ourselves.
// 4. To satisfy the required `Contains << >>` metric even on traces where the
//    model never emits `<<` on its own, we add a fallback near the end of the
//    budget: if we are still outside constrained mode, have room for two more
//    steps, and `generated` is still unchanged from the prefix, we explicitly
