//    soon as a complete constrained prefix is reached, preventing the previous
//    runaway behavior.
// 5. If a constrained prefix becomes narrow, we repair by rolling back to a
//    valid boundary and trimming `generated` accordingly; this branch consumes
//    one step even if it appends nothing, preserving the decreases discipline.
//
